OL,3,GNEWSABusiness leaders urge PM to
OL,4,Afast-track reservoir plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of business leaders have called
OL,7,Fon the prime minister to fast-track
OL,8,Fplanning approval for a proposed #6.6bn
OL,9,Freservoir.
OL,11,FUnder Thames Water's proposals, the
OL,12,FWhite Horse Reservoir, near Abingdon in
OL,13,FOxfordshire, could supply 15 million
OL,14,Fpeople in the south east of England.
OL,16,FThe scheme has been met with a mixed
OL,17,Fresponse from residents, with
OL,18,Fcampaigners saying it would devastate
OL,19,Flocal ecology and livelihoods.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
