OL,3,GNEWSABusiness leaders urge PM to
OL,4,Afast-track reservoir plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in a letter to Andy Burnham on
OL,7,FTuesday, a group - including the Thames
OL,8,FValley Chamber of Commerce - called on
OL,9,Fthe government to designate the
OL,10,Fproposals as a critical national
OL,11,Fpriority.
